  shell/MapboxMapSurface.kt event markers) to mark a published, upcoming event —
  deliberately distinct from the incident glyphs (which are road-hazard symbols)
  so an event pin never reads as a traffic alert.

  Tinted at runtime like the incident glyphs.
-->
